#### Level 2: Circuit Remains Open (> 15 minutes)

**Escalation Trigger:** Circuit open for more than 15 minutes

**Additional Actions:**
1. Escalate to senior engineer and service owner
2. Engage vendor/third-party if external dependency
3. Review fallback data staleness
4. Consider manual circuit closure if dependency confirmed healthy
5. Initiate incident communication to stakeholders

**Communication Template:**
