Subject: [INCIDENT] {Service} Circuit Breaker Open - Degraded Mode

Circuit breaker for {dependency} opened at {time}.
Current Status: {Open/Half-Open}
Impact: {description of degraded functionality}
User Impact: {number} users experiencing {impact type}
Fallback Status: {Active/Cached data age}
ETA for Resolution: {estimate or "Investigating"}
Next Update: {time}
